{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061687/block/singleImage/3256099/df/01M6FM4ETQ70DFZN87B03YHVTB.jpg?updatedAt=1793673337\"/><figcaption>筲箕灣耀東邨耀華樓。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>筲箕灣耀東邨發生燒炭案。 今日（3日）早上6時35分，筲箕灣耀東邨耀華樓一名住戶收到鄰居傳來的尋死訊息，於是向保安求助。保安得悉後立即報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，消防破門進入單位內，發現一名60餘歲老翁倒臥屋內，身旁有燒炭痕迹，經檢驗後證實當場不治。警方正在調查事主尋死原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.579676+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:35:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:22.705383+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:39.625784+00:00","content_hash":"735bd51839d606052931978282cb5e75bf3c3bbd69abf9cc799ec078b1aaf5a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.579676+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}